    "display_name": "How To: Add Image Context",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "# How To: Add Image Context\n\nImages help AI see what you mean. Adding visual context, like a layout, flowchart, or sketch, makes your prompt clearer and your results more accurate.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/41a84d3ffd2a38785562ac41aec9b410-ai-curriculum-societal-impacts.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-image-context-test-2025-90f598cf-70ae-4ddf-8788-cdd69b931239"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 1:\n\nClick **Add file** and upload a screenshot or photo that shows what you’re working on (for example, your webpage layout or wireframe).",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/28a5845720f6b37b9d2975c1efbd74e8-p1.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-image-context-test-2025-fe585fd5-6be2-4d90-84a9-e04d332f1182"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 2:\n\nIn the prompt box, describe what’s happening in the image and what you want AI to do. Mention the image directly so it knows to use it as context.\n\n**Example:** *“In the attached screenshot, you can see the brand kit. The button doesn’t match the secondary color. Can you suggest how I should update it to align with the brand kit?”*",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/d41e07beb6a74a5c9067897bdbf27ad5-Pasted Graphic 15.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-image-context-test-2025-dcaeae89-d30c-404b-b479-06bfe7f8cc6c"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 3:\n\nSend your prompt and review how AI uses the image details in its response.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/9aa26b33509e45ae17da470dc7708858-Pasted Graphic 17.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-image-context-test-2025-6f5fae24-4402-428b-ba31-5bb8cc8526be"
      }
    ]
  },
